# Controlled checkout fixture

```engineering-source-refs
- id: SRC-1
  type: document
  ref: checkout.mjs
```

```engineering-targets
- id: TARGET-1
  component: checkout
  paths: [checkout.mjs]
  change_policy: modify
```

```engineering-constraints
- id: RECEIPT-ONE
  level: must
  statement: After recovery each successfully charged order has exactly one receipt.
  enforcement: { kind: test, verifier_ref: VER-RECEIPT }
```

```engineering-verification
- id: VER-RECEIPT
  kind: test
  proves: [RECEIPT-ONE]
  runner: { type: reference, reference: controlled checkout corpus }
```
